--- a/SPIKE-NOTES.md
+++ b/SPIKE-NOTES.md
@@ -409,3 +409,153 @@ switching to a link that is actually offered fixed it on the first retry, no cod
   a real OpenAI-compatible key for `TEXT_MODEL_API_KEY` (OpenRouter/DeepSeek) to use the
